the Company has concluded it is reasonably certain to extend available options through December 2031.</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SaleLeasebackTransactionDescriptionOfAssetS_c20080701__20080731__us-gaap--BusinessCombinationSeparatelyRecognizedTransactionsAxis__custom--EolaHillsMember_zpYy4a3EAit7"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2008-07-012008-07-31_custom_EolaHillsMember" id="Fact000761" name="us-gaap:SaleLeasebackTransactionDescriptionOfAssetS">In
<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SaleLeasebackTransactionDate_c20080701__20080731__us-gaap--BusinessCombinationSeparatelyRecognizedTransactionsAxis__custom--EolaHillsMember_zQdywsq7r0t5"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2008-07-012008-07-31_custom_EolaHillsMember" id="Fact000762" name="us-gaap:SaleLeasebackTransactionDate">July 2008</ix:nonNumeric></span>, the Company entered into a <span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--SaleLeasebackTransactionLeaseDuration_dtYxH_c20080701__20080731__us-gaap--BusinessCombinationSeparatelyRecognizedTransactionsAxis__custom--EolaHillsMember_zZPGHyF5irr7">34</span> year lease agreement with a property owner in the Eola Hills for approximately 110 acres adjacent
