referred to as part of Ingram Vineyard and includes 93 acres of producing vineyards and 17 additional plantable acres. For right of use
asset and liability calculations the Company has concluded it is reasonably certain to extend available options through December 2053.</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SaleLeasebackTransactionDescriptionOfAssetS_c20170601__20170630__us-gaap--BusinessCombinationSeparatelyRecognizedTransactionsAxis__custom--DundeeMember_z3L9a9IJVbhc"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2017-06-012017-06-30_custom_DundeeMember" id="Fact000764" name="us-gaap:SaleLeasebackTransactionDescriptionOfAssetS">In
