1.6%, in the current year period over the prior year period. This decrease was caused by <span style="background-color: white">a decrease
in direct sales of $262,493, partly offset by an increase in sales through distributors of $103,005 in the current year three-month period
over the prior year period. </span>The decrease in revenue from direct sales was primarily related to lower outpost sales. Sales revenue
