in net loss for the first half of 2026, compared to the comparable periods in 2025, was primarily the result of lower gross profit and
higher selling expenses and increased allowance for credit losses in 2026.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

